# This repo root is mods/unpacked/ so both mods can stay live-editable in place
# for BeamNG to load directly. Only the two mods below are tracked — everything
# else that BeamNG.drive or other mods drop in this folder is ignored.
/*
!/fueltech_boost_controller/
!/sunburst2_ej_engines/
!/.gitignore
!/.github/

# Local release zips (built by hand for the BeamNG repo upload —
# the GitHub release workflows build a fresh one in CI).
**/dist/
